'''Sigh of Relief''' (ホッと一息, ''Hotto Hitoiki'', '''A Moment to Breathe''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Research Power UP (M): All Cats' recharge times are reduced by 52 frames (1.73 sec).

